cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SPHEREx Flipbook (paramost)"
abstract: >-
  Watch a patch of sky change in NASA SPHEREx images: videos of every visit,
  difference pictures, Gaia DR3 and CatWISE2020 overlays, light curves and
  spectra measured from the images. Built for the NASA Space Apps Challenge
  2026 (Planet X and SPHEREx).
